### What Are Common Interview Follow-Up Questions?

Interviewers commonly ask:

- Wildcard Matching: star is standalone, not tied to preceding element.
- What if star can appear alone (not after another char)? Invalid pattern in standard regex.
- Support `+` (one or more): same as star but without the zero case.
- Support `?` (zero or one): replace dp[i-1][j] with dp[i-1][j-2] for the one case.

```java
package com.bank.core;

public class RegexFollowUps {
    // Wildcard: * is standalone, simpler star logic
    // Plus (+): one or more = firstMatch && dp[i-1][j] (no zero case)
    // Question mark (?): zero or one = dp[i][j-2] || (firstMatch && dp[i-1][j-2])
}
```
